      "writtenOn": "2023-11-28T00:26:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No, both look fine to me. In fact in Kleaf\u0027s code, you\u0027ll see many instances of `\"{}/{}\".format(...)` but hardly any `a + \"/\" + b`.",
